00:31:51.660 --> 00:31:53.610
concepts, which we needed.

00:31:53.610 --> 00:31:55.470
I think it's now more
than time that we

00:31:55.470 --> 00:31:58.710
dive into some of the technical
details of this project

00:31:58.710 --> 00:32:00.650
to show some technical
meat to the bone.

00:32:00.650 --> 00:32:03.134
And I'd like to have on
stage, Peter Wiggers.

00:32:13.090 --> 00:32:15.190
PETER WIGGERS: So my
name is Peter Wiggers.

00:32:15.190 --> 00:32:17.890
I'm the Cloud architect
